{"batchcomplete":"","query":{"pages":{"114025594":{"pageid":114025594,"ns":6,"title":"File:Some of the Tesla Model 3 design sketches (26200187902).jpg","imagerepository":"local","imageinfo":[{"size":1287251,"width":2918,"height":2324,"thumburl":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/37/Some_of_the_Tesla_Model_3_design_sketches_%2826200187902%29.jpg/500px-Some_of_the_Tesla_Model_3_design_sketches_%2826200187902%29.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","thumbwidth":480,"thumbheight":382,"responsiveUrls":{"2":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/37/Some_of_the_Tesla_Model_3_design_sketches_%2826200187902%29.jpg/960px-Some_of_the_Tesla_Model_3_design_sketches_%2826200187902%29.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail"},"thumbattribs":{"src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/37/Some_of_the_Tesla_Model_3_design_sketches_%2826200187902%29.jpg/500px-Some_of_the_Tesla_Model_3_design_sketches_%2826200187902%29.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","decoding":"async","loading":"lazy","width":480,"height":382,"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/37/Some_of_the_Tesla_Model_3_design_sketches_%2826200187902%29.jpg/960px-Some_of_the_Tesla_Model_3_design_sketches_%2826200187902%29.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail 2x"},"url":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/3/37/Some_of_the_Tesla_Model_3_design_sketches_%2826200187902%29.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","descriptionurl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Some_of_the_Tesla_Model_3_design_sketches_(26200187902).jpg","descriptionshorturl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/w/index.php?curid=114025594","extmetadata":{"ImageDescription":{"value":"<p>The Tesla Design Studio is next to SpaceX in LA.  &lt;a href=\"<a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://www.flickr.com/photos/jurvetson/26147878656\">https://www.flickr.com/photos/jurvetson/26147878656</a>\"&gt;Franz&lt;/a&gt; and team have sculpted a visual beauty, while achieving an impressively low coefficient of drag (essential to EV efficiency).\n</p><p>I recently &lt;a href=\"<a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://www.flickr.com/photos/jurvetson/23106699373\">https://www.flickr.com/photos/jurvetson/23106699373</a>\"&gt;interviewed Elon&lt;/a&gt; about design and aesthetics, and he offered a fascinating &lt;a href=\"<a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=SVk1hb0ZOrE&amp;&amp;t=43m15s\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=SVk1hb0ZOrE&amp;&amp;t=43m15s</a>\" rel=\"nofollow\"&gt;peek into his mind&lt;/a&gt;.  I stayed with the subject and by &lt;a href=\"<a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=SVk1hb0ZOrE&amp;&amp;t=45m53s\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=SVk1hb0ZOrE&amp;&amp;t=45m53s</a>\" rel=\"nofollow\"&gt;minute 46 to 48&lt;/a&gt;, he describes his visceral agitation with imperfection, and the need to shut that off sometimes.\n</p><p>After \u201cthe highest single-day sales of any product of any kind ever in world history\u201d (&lt;a href=\"<a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"http://electrek.co/2016/04/07/tesla-model-3-production-plans/\">http://electrek.co/2016/04/07/tesla-model-3-production-plans/</a>\" rel=\"nofollow\"&gt;Electrek&lt;/a&gt;), the first week rolled in \u201c325,000 reservations, which corresponds to about $14 billion in implied future sales, making this the single biggest one-week launch of any product ever. This interest has spread completely organically.\u201d (&lt;a href=\"<a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://www.teslamotors.com/node/16632?utm_campaign=Blog_Model3_040716&amp;utm_source=Twitter&amp;utm_medium=social&amp;no_cache=1460043845\">https://www.teslamotors.com/node/16632?utm_campaign=Blog_Model3_040716&amp;utm_source=Twitter&amp;utm_medium=social&amp;no_cache=1460043845</a>\" rel=\"nofollow\"&gt;Tesla Blog&lt;/a&gt;)\n</p>\nAnd in the category of the surreal, here is a &lt;a href=\"<a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=jFtJR5yhutU\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=jFtJR5yhutU</a>\" rel=\"nofollow\"&gt;Tesla racing a Boeing 737&lt;/a&gt;...  The new performance metric: Zero-to-liftoff in X seconds. =)","source":"commons-desc-page"},"DateTimeOriginal":{"value":"2016-04-07 08:52","source":"commons-desc-page"},"Artist":{"value":"<a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.flickr.com/people/44124348109@N01\">Steve Jurvetson</a> from Los Altos, USA","source":"commons-desc-page"},"LicenseShortName":{"value":"CC BY 2.0","source":"commons-desc-page","hidden":""}}}]},"55965048":{"pageid":55965048,"ns":6,"title":"File:Tesla Model 3 Logo.png","imagerepository":"local","imageinfo":[{"size":6079,"width":800,"height":600,"thumburl":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/c/cc/Tesla_Model_3_Logo.png/500px-Tesla_Model_3_Logo.png?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","thumbwidth":480,"thumbheight":360,"responsiveUrls":{"2":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/c/cc/Tesla_Model_3_Logo.png?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled"},"thumbattribs":{"src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/c/cc/Tesla_Model_3_Logo.png/500px-Tesla_Model_3_Logo.png?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","decoding":"async","loading":"lazy","width":480,"height":360,"srcset":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/c/cc/Tesla_Model_3_Logo.png?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled 2x"},"url":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/c/cc/Tesla_Model_3_Logo.